  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2020-2026 Mazda CX-30.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR floor mats fit for 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 Mazda CX-30. All these car floor mats were made using 3D laser scanning technology to ensure tailored fit and full contoured protection\nBuilt for Durability: These floor mats are crafted from high-density TPE material that can last for years, and contain no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC. Resilient enough to work in arctic cold as well as tropical heat\nAll-Weather Guard: These floor liners feature expertly designed channels and raised edges that trap snow, mud, liquids, and debris. They work all year long to keep your car interior cleaner and more comfortable\nEasy To Clean: Simply clean the waterproof floor mats by shaking the dirt off from the textured skid-resistant surface or by rinsing off with a hose. No vacuuming or detergent is needed for maintenance\nWhy YITAMOTOR: YITAMOTOR automotive floor liner applies high-grade material processed with advanced technology to achieve optimal custom protection, underfoot comfort, and all-weather durability",
